      381.97,
      539.78,
      404.08
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Justice and Prison Reforms under Sections 6 and 10 read with section 63 of theDebt Conciliation Ordinance (Chapter 81).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
