  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      432.09,
      414.01,
      527.48,
      425.08
    ],
    "text": "Minister of Justice and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      424.93,
      514.06,
      458.08
    ],
    "text": "Prison Reforms.Colombo,20th July, 2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      266.85,
      457.93,
      320.85,
      469.0
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      478.93,
      539.89,
      501.04
    ],
    "text": "1. The Debt Conciliation Regulations, 1942, published in Gazette No. 8979 of July, 31st 1942 as amended fromtime to time are further amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.85,
      510.97,
      404.86,
      522.04
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the substitution for regulation 3 thereof of the following regulation:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      531.97,
      539.86,
      554.08
    ],
    "text": "\u201c3. (1) Every member of the Board or of a Branch Board who attends a meeting of the Board or of aBranch Board shall be paid a fee of Rupees Three Thousand in respect of each sitting.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      107.85,
      564.01,
      539.93,
      586.0
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Chairman of a Board who attends a meeting of the Board shall be paid a fee of Rupees FiveThousand in respect of each sitting.\u201d ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      92.85,
      595.93,
      206.84,
      607.0
    ],
    "text": "(2) in regulation 4 thereof -",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      110.85,
      616.93,
      539.84,
      639.04
    ],
    "text": "(a)in paragraph (1) of that regulation by the substitution for sub-paragraph (ii), of the following sub-paragraph:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      131.85,
      649.93,
      539.89,
      661.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(ii) where a member uses a motor vehicle to attend a meeting, Rupees One Thousand per meeting",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      155.85,
      660.97,
      410.91,
      672.04
    ],
    "text": "and in the case of the Chairman, Two Thousand per meeting.\u201d ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      682.93,
      433.72,
      694.0
    ],
    "text": "2. These regulations shall be deemed to have come into force on November, 1, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
